      "record_ids": ["persons:QQ100814C", "PEN-00023", "CAP-00019"],
      "reason": "Leonard has reached State Pension age (born 1951) and lives in England. However, his assessed weekly income (state pension £225.26 + private pension £180.28 = £405.54) plus deemed income from savings (£72,985 - £10,000 = £62,985; £62,985/£500 = 126 units → £126/week) totals £531.54/week, which exceeds the single Guarantee Credit threshold of £238/week. Therefore no entitlement."
    },
