      "record_ids": ["persons:QQ100814C", "note:HH-019.txt"],
      "reason": "Leonard is over State Pension age, has been resident in GB since 1975, and the caseworker note confirms he has needed help with washing, dressing and medication both day and night for 28 months (well over 6 months). No evidence he receives DLA, PIP or Adult Disability Payment. Because care is needed day and night, the higher rate of £114.60/week applies."
    },
    {
      "benefit": "council_tax_reduction",
      "decision": "not_eligible",
