      "record_ids": ["persons:QQ100814C", "CT-70234", "CAP-00019"],
      "reason": "Leonard is liable for council tax (band D, single person discount) and has reached State Pension age. However, his capital (savings £72,985) exceeds the £16,000 capital limit for the pensioner scheme (CTR-5). He does not receive Guarantee Credit (CTR-4), so the capital limit applies and he cannot get a reduction."
    },
