      "record_ids": ["persons:QQ100814C", "PEN-00023", "note:HH-019.txt"],
      "reason": "The scheme covers England (Leonard lives in England). Eligibility requires receipt of a qualifying means-tested benefit (Pension Credit, Housing Benefit, Universal Credit or income-related ESA) on 23 August 2026. Leonard is not entitled to Pension Credit (see above) and there is no record of the other benefits. Therefore he does not meet the qualifying benefit condition."
    }
